---
title: Lying Resistance Band Chest Press
type: docs
prev: docs/grud/
---
![жим резинок лежа на грудные](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bf2fbf58-3a11-4ce0-9bd1-019d545ac87f)


{{% steps %}}

### Step 1
Sit on a workout mat, wrap the resistance band behind your back across your shoulder blades, and hold each end in your hands.

### Step 2
Lie flat on your back on the mat.

### Step 3
Rest your upper arms on the floor with your elbows angled at about 45 degrees away from your body, keeping your forearms pointing straight up toward the ceiling.

### Step 4
Press your hips and shoulder blades firmly into the floor and keep your chest open.

### Step 5
Bend your knees and plant your feet flat on the floor shoulder-width apart. Tighten your core and glutes to stay stable.

### Step 6
Exhale and press your hands straight up toward the ceiling, bringing them together over your chest.

### Step 7
Inhale and slowly lower your arms back down until the backs of your arms lightly touch the floor.

### Step 8
Without relaxing the tension at the bottom, immediately begin the next rep.

{{% /steps %}}

{{< callout type="info" >}}
• Avoid bouncing or using momentum—keep the movement smooth and controlled.

• Do not aggressively lock out your elbows at the top of the press.

• Keep your hips firmly on the floor; do not arch your body upward to press the band.
{{< /callout >}}
